      "widgets_values": [
        "Use the supplied reference image as the exact character identity and appearance.\n\nA single character stands perfectly still in a neutral standing pose throughout the entire video. Preserve the exact facial identity, hairstyle, clothing, body proportions, textures, silhouette, and accessories of the reference character.\n\nFollow the supplied pose control video frame by frame. The character's joints, body position, limb orientation, scale, and framing should closely match the pose guidance at every frame.\n\nThe camera performs one smooth, continuous 360-degree horizontal orbit around the stationary character. Begin at the front view, smoothly transition through the side view, reach the back view at the midpoint, continue through the opposite side view, and return to the front view at the end.\n\nConstant camera height, distance, focal length, lighting, and framing. The character remains centered and fully visible.\n\nThe character does not rotate, walk, move, gesture, or change pose. No cuts, no zoom, no camera shake, no anatomical deformation, no identity changes, no clothing changes, no background changes.\n\nAudio: Silence."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "value": "Use the supplied reference image as the exact character identity and appearance.\n\nA single character stands perfectly still in a neutral standing pose throughout the entire video. Preserve the exact facial identity, hairstyle, clothing, body proportions, textures, silhouette, and accessories of the reference character.\n\nFollow the supplied pose control video frame by frame. The character's joints, body position, limb orientation, scale, and framing should closely match the pose guidance at every frame.\n\nThe camera performs one smooth, continuous 360-degree horizontal orbit around the stationary character. Begin at the front view, smoothly transition through the side view, reach the back view at the midpoint, continue through the opposite side view, and return to the front view at the end.\n\nConstant camera height, distance, focal length, lighting, and framing. The character remains centered and fully visible.\n\nThe character does not rotate, walk, move, gesture, or change pose. No cuts, no zoom, no camera shake, no anatomical deformation, no identity changes, no clothing changes, no background changes.\n\nAudio: Silence."
